-# Static sample of the MgrStance+Rating Matrix for page help (not live data).
.border.rounded.p-3.bg-white
  %p.small.fw-semibold.mb-2 Example: MgrStance+Rating Matrix
  %p.small.text-muted.mb-3
    Each person plots once: keeper stance (rows) × last finalized position rating (columns). Clusters tell a story... protective keepers who are already exceptional, solid fits across the middle, or “take the swap” next to weak overall ratings that deserve a candid conversation.

  .table-responsive.mb-0
    %table.table.table-bordered.mb-0.small
      %thead
        %tr
          %th.align-middle.text-muted Worst ↑ / Best →
          %th.text-center Developing
          %th.text-center Accomplished
          %th.text-center Exceptional
      %tbody
        %tr
          %th.align-middle.text-success I'd work to avoid the swap
          %td.text-center.text-muted ...
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-success Sofia
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-success Maya
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-success Priya
        %tr
          %th.align-middle.text-info I'd do nothing
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-info Riley
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-info Casey
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-info Morgan
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-info Avery
        %tr
          %th.align-middle.text-warning I'd take the swap
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-warning Quinn
          %td.text-center.text-muted ...
          %td.text-center.text-muted ...

  %ul.small.mb-0.mt-3
    %li
      %strong Top-right
      (avoid the swap + exceptional) is the density you want to protect and grow from.
    %li
      %strong Bottom-left
      (take the swap + developing) is often the kindest place to act... for the teammate and the seat.
    %li Guidance+Rating and Assignment Rating Alignment add assignment-energy and emp/mgr agreement so the conversation stays specific, not vibes.
